<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Daehan Flour buys 22,000 tonnes of wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Daehan Flour buys 22,000 tonnes of wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daehan Flour Mills Co Ltd said on Wednesday it has bought 22,000 tonnes of U.S. No.1 wheat from Japanese trading house Mitsubishi Corp.  </p>
<p>A Daehan official said shipment was set for February 1-28 to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>Details for the results are as follow:</p>
<p>  TYPE OF WHEAT	     TONNE	PRICE/T (FOB)</p>
<p>  Soft White		 10,500	 $149.50</p>
<p>(protein max 10 percent)</p>
<p>  Hard Red Winter	   2,500	 $177.90</p>
<p>  Dark Northern Spring    9,000	 $179.65</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
